<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">2、<SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'">            </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">水果请跟陈幼花老师联系，去演播室领取。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 22pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore">3、<SPAN style="FONT: 7pt 'Times New Roman'">            </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; FONT-SIZE: 12pt">各组在去的时候先电话联系一下，确定具体的地址（个别老师可能居住地变换）如果在外地的，请组长打个电话表示问候。<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                          </SPAN><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
